  "body": "Ports the validated integrity work from the old #66 audit onto the current post-#79 main without regressing later PRICE_PROBE/history/browser changes.\n\nKey points:\n- durable cross-bot negotiation ownership before FIRST_OFFER\n- safe release/reopen semantics before submit; fail-closed after confirmed/ambiguous submit\n- bot_command deletion cascades\n- per-step read/unread follow-up delays through DB/backend/frontend/Playwright\n- ACTION_REQUIRED no longer consumes automated future-step capacity\n- hidden production per-run negotiation throttles removed unless explicitly configured\n- targeting regressions and Galaxy Tab S11 Ultra coverage\n- old audit migrations renumbered to V33/V34 because current main already owns V30-V32\n- PostgreSQL migration smoke test added to CI\n- keeps the newer main FilterActions implementation/tests instead of overwriting them with the older audit copy\n\nThis PR is intended to be merged immediately once all CI jobs are green; the obsolete #66 will then be closed.",
